{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40093","label":"GODDESS FALL · Part 1"},"label":"2,000: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_goddessfall1_06_s","next":null,"speakers":{"nayuta":"Nayuta","cecil":"Cecil","crown":"Crown","chime":"Chime","kilo":"Kilo","kilo_op_r":"Kilo","talos":"T.A.L.O.S.","indivilia":"Indivilia","nihilister_m":"Nihilister","talkative":"Chatterbox","cecil_op_r":"Cecil","harran_op_r":"Harran","isabel_op_l":"Isabel","papillon_op_l":"Papillon","johan":"Johan","rapunzel":"Rapunzel","marian_q":"Marian","cecil_op_l":"Cecil","snowwhite":"Snow White","hongryeon":"Scarlet","harran":"Harran","isabel":"Isabel"},"icons":{"nayuta":"si_c223_00_s","cecil":"si_c929_00_s","crown":"si_c330_00_s","chime":"si_c331_00_s","kilo":"si_c977_00_s","kilo_op_r":"si_c977_00_s","talos":"si_c361_00_s","indivilia":"si_c263_00_s","nihilister_m":"si_c9009_00_s","cecil_op_r":"si_c929_00_s","harran_op_r":"si_c230_00_s","isabel_op_l":"si_c231_00_s","papillon_op_l":"si_c890_00_s","johan":"si_c925_00_s","rapunzel":"si_c221_00_s","marian_q":"si_c260_02_s","cecil_op_l":"si_c929_00_s","snowwhite":"si_c220_00_s","hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s","harran":"si_c230_00_s","isabel":"si_c231_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_1","text":"I possess but one rather insignificant talent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_13","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_13","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_goddessfall_hurricanes_inst","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_2","text":"I can fashion replicas of myself, identical in form, and grant unto them a portion of my NIMPH.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_3","text":"Once the NIMPH setteth within a replica, there existeth no whit of difference betwixt it and myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_4","text":"They are able to think and to act of their own accord.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_5","text":"As for their number...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_6","text":"Well, I ceased counting after three thousand and two hundred. The greater their multitude, the more wondrous it be, wouldst thou not agree?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_7","text":"These replicas wander the world, gathering whatsoever knowledge they may procure—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_8","text":"the Queen's movements, the Heretics' designs, the changes that befall the land, and the like.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_9","text":"Now, thou mayest wonder: how is all this knowledge made one?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_10","text":"When a replica perisheth, or when I so will it, the NIMPH within returneth unto me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_11","text":"And with it, the knowledge it hath borne doth flow unto me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_12","text":"A replica bereft of its NIMPH, alas, is naught but a hollow shell, stripped of all its faculties.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_13","text":"Thus, they are not so formidable as they might seem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_14","text":"Yet gathering knowledge is not their sole purpose.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_15","text":"Among them are those trained chiefly for battle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_16","text":"Dost thou grasp the meaning I endeavor to impart?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_17","text":"These two thousand replicas now assembled upon this battlefield","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_18","text":"are precisely those honed for combat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_19","text":"Though they may not rival the exalted Forerunners nor the Inherit,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_20","text":"they are by no means trifling foes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_21","text":"So then, thou seest I have not idled away my time in vain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_22","text":"... Embarrassing though it be to confess, all my replicas—save for mine own self—are grievously inept at finding our way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_23","text":"Without a guiding signal, we should surely stray into some desolate place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_24","text":"Though I may have appeared idle, I assure thee I have been diligently dispatching signals to steer their course. Therefore, I beseech thee, judge me not too harshly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_25","text":"I understand. Now come down. We are about to fire Eden's Spear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BrokenEdenLobby","bgArt":"brokenedenlobby","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["nayuta","cecil"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_26","text":"Remain there, and you'll end up a thoroughly roasted monk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_27","text":"... Verily, 'twas not that I sought words of gratitude, yet this—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_28","text":"Step on it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_29","text":"As you wish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_30","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_30","text":"The clones dash across the plains.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_12_1","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_12_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_31","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_31","text":"One sends Raptures flying with a palm strike,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_32","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_32","text":"while another crushes a Rapture's armor with a swing of a stone staff.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_33","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_33","text":"A third pierces a core with a spear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_34","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_34","text":"Two thousand clones overwhelm the Raptures with their own weapons and techniques.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_35","text":"... Quite the sight to bedeck.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_36","text":"Behold... It's behold, Your Highness.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"kilo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_37","text":"... Amazing. This is really...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_38","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_38","text":"Bullets spray from one clone,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_12_2","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_12_2","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_39","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_39","text":"rockets blast from another.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_40","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_40","text":"One hurls grenades,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_41","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_41","text":"while another lays mines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"kilo_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_42","text":"Uh, don't they seem to be fighting a little too recklessly?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"land_d","bgArt":"land_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["talos","kilo_op_r"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_43","text":"Affirmative.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_44","text":"S-so long as we triumph, that is all that needeth be!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["chime","crown","talkative","indivilia","nihilister_m"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"indivilia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_45","text":"... Tsk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_46","text":"Oi! What the hell are you doing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"indivilia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_47","text":"What of it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_48","text":"You should be running for your life, not clicking your tongue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_49","text":"... Agreed. We can't take them down now. There aren't enough of us Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"indivilia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_50","text":"... Very well, let's do so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"indivilia","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_51","text":"I trust the exalted one above will see to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_06_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_06_e_52","text":"Running away, are we? That is one thing you truly excel at.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"mo